    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1 The Orchard is a most attractive 2 bedroom (plus Attic) end of terrace townhouse nestled in a quiet cul-de-sac, minutes’ walk from Ranelagh main Street, Donnybrook Village and Herbert Park in Ballsbridge.  Bushfield Avenue sits in a pocket of Dublin 4 that blends old world charm with exceptional convenience. The house is a deceptively spacious 87 sqm /936 sq ft (plus attic), with an enclosed private South facing rear garden overlooking the grounds of Muckross Park girls school.\r\nAccording to the experts location, location, location is the only criteria that we should consider when making a property investment and in the case of 1 The Orchard this is a no brainer. Within walking distance to the bustle of Ranelagh main street, with its choice of fine eateries, traditional pubs and excellent shops, to the quiet calm of Herbert Park and its wide open green spaces, weekend markets, tennis courts, scenic walks, playgrounds and mini lakes.   \r\nRanelagh is a busy and well loved neighbourhood with a wide variety of social and essential amenities all within walking distance of Bushfield Avenue. The LUAS at Ranelagh, the S6 & 11 bus routes and Aircoach stops nearby.\r\n \r\nThere are many primary schools close by, including St Marys, Scoil Brid, Ranelagh multi-denominational, Lios na N’Og and Sandford NS. Post primary schools in the vicinity include Gonzaga, Sandford Park, Muckross Park, Alexander Park, etc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALL DOOR to\r\n\r\nHALLWAY with door to\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM with feature wood surround fireplace. Wood floor. Archway to\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/BREAKFAST/SUN ROOM with extensive range of kitchen units, worktop, sink unit, gas hob, extractor, electric cooker, fridge/freezer, dishwasher and washing machine. Splash back tiling. Wooden & tiled floor.\r\n\r\nDouble doors to rear patio, with views across Muckross grounds.\r\n\r\nDoor to stairway with wood panelling.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLANDING with wood panelling\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 (front) with built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 (rear) with built in wardrobes, work table and shelving. Views across south city.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM Shower unit, wc, whb, heated towel rail, tile floor. Wood panelling.\r\n\r\nATTIC FLOOR\r\n\r\nATTIC ROOM"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SUPERBLY LOCATED WITHIN EASY WALKING DISTANCE OF RANELAGH VILLAGE, DONNYBROOK VILLAGE AND HERBERT PARK/BALLSBRIDGE.\r\n\r\nEXCELLENT, BRIGHT & SPACIOUS ACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nVIEWS ACROSS SOUTH CITY TOWARDS DUBLIN MOUNTAINS FROM FIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nENCLOSED PRIVATE REAR PATIO THAT FACES SOUTH AND OVERLOOKS MUCKROSS PARK SCHOOL GROUNDS. GARDEN SHED.\r\n\r\nGAS C/H\r\n\r\nDOUBLED GLAZED THROUGHOUT\r\n\r\nSIDE PASSAGE WITH SECURITY GATE\r\n\r\nPARKING AT FRONT"
      },
      {
